+Only `candidate` and `employer` can self-register. Create an admin with:
+`ADMIN_EMAIL=you@example.com ADMIN_PASSWORD='long-password' npm run seed:admin`
+(this also promotes an existing user with that email). Passwords must be 8+ characters.
+
